{"availability":"available","full":"meroxis/nuvabill","name":"nuvabill","description":"Free, open-source WHMCS alternative for hosting companies: billing, invoices, domains and support tickets, with cPanel, DirectAdmin, Plesk, Proxmox and Virtualizor automation, Stripe, PayPal and a WHMCS importer.","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":13,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T17:10:46Z","updated":"2026-10-04T07:11:25Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nuvabill.com","topics":["billing","billing-software","client-area","cpanel","directadmin","hosting","hosting-billing","invoicing","laravel","open-source","paypal","php","plesk","proxmox","self-hosted","stripe","web-hosting","whm","whmcs","whmcs-alternative"],"demo":"https://demo.nuvabill.com/admin/login","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:11.273Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:11.273Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:11.273Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:11.273Z","stars":13,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The free, open-source WHMCS alternative for hosting companies. Billing, automation and support. Built for phones first.","Website · Live demo · Getting started · Features · Nuvabill vs WHMCS · Docs · Roadmap","Nuvabill is free, open-source billing software for web hosting companies, written from scratch as a modern alternative to WHMCS. It sells your hosting plans and domains, bills clients every month, creates their cPanel, DirectAdmin, Plesk, Proxmox or Virtualizor accounts the moment they pay, suspends late payers, and handles support tickets. It is licensed under the AGPL: there is no license fee and no per-client pricing, and moving from WHMCS takes one import."],"features":["a module or integration Nuvabill does not have yet (WHMCS has a large third-party ecosystem)","a long track record and a commercial support contract"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/meroxis/nuvabill/blob/main/README.m